          "id": "22aa6ddbe448829ac662f92de4ae60980a16ad1d4e234b97d6980a795dd32a89",
          "time": "2026-09-24T21:46:42+08:00",
          "central_bank": "BOE",
          "headline": "BoE Breeden: The larger and longer the energy shock, the more likely policy will need to respond."
        },
        {
          "id": "4a83f47a46052d3936422544b0d016cc4cbebdb3d5ed1d99895ecc078415f600",
          "time": "2026-09-24T21:47:18+08:00",
          "central_bank": "BOE",
          "headline": "BoE Breeden: The balance of risks has shifted, if risks crystallise, it is increasingly likely that the BoE will need to respond."
