          "time": "2026-09-24T21:53:05+08:00",
          "central_bank": "BOE",
          "headline": "BoE Breeden: Unlike in 2022, we're starting at a point where policy is restrictive."
        },
        {
          "id": "a33934a8886f2d4d3707a54a09ee03aadfccb6ad861117a09700b86faaacf9c4",
          "time": "2026-09-24T21:53:57+08:00",
          "central_bank": "BOE",
          "headline": "BoE Breeden: We have to take a meeting-by-meeting approach to the rate decisions."
        },
        {
          "id": "f3e63e5a51cf3e200d672f0e960c7b3c7325c24494647ae94dcf035bcf4c6b76",
          "time": "2026-09-24T21:54:37+08:00",
          "central_bank": "BOE",
          "headline": "BoE Breeden: The question for me is whether we need to do a first move, there is more uncertainty about whether we need to do lots more."
        },
