          "time": "2026-09-24T21:55:06+08:00",
          "central_bank": "BOE",
          "headline": "BoE Breeden: We may find over time that we need to do a lot more."
        },
        {
          "id": "ba59ce7c76ca655474ce8ab0ea4686e459ca877031d53a1880bcc6fbd4201241",
          "time": "2026-09-24T21:56:40+08:00",
          "central_bank": "BOE",
          "headline": "BoE Breeden: It is incredibly important that the BoE has set out a plan to exit QE, it makes it a more credible tool."
        },
