          "id": "65d2e10bc577c63980f2c6c15754f62c8edaed644fe964ca69096b11490d52f7",
          "time": "2026-09-24T22:20:16+08:00",
          "central_bank": "BOE",
          "headline": "BoE Breeden: We cannot ignore moves in the OIS interest rate futures market, need to understand what's going on."
        },
        {
